  "id": "a-run-records-the-directory-it-happened-in",
  "title": "A run records the directory it happened in",
  "requirement": "A recorded red names the tree it was observed in: case_run takes cwd (absolute or workspace-relative, default the session workspace) and stores cwd and cwdRelative with the run, case_verify records the directory of the observation, and case_get shows both (REQ-180).",
  "kind": "regression",
  "status": "verified",
  "source": "agent",
  "automated": true,
  "testPath": "plugins/test-cases/test/run-cwd-pinned.test.mjs",
  "runCommand": "node --test plugins/test-cases/test/run-cwd-pinned.test.mjs",
  "steps": [
    "Record an automated case whose command prints its own working directory",
    "Run it with cwd pointing at a copy of the tree, then without cwd",
    "Read run.json and case_get for the recorded directories"
  ],
  "expected": "the copy run records cwd=<copy>/cwdRelative=copy-of-tree and the command really echoed that path; the second run records the workspace; case_get shows the last run and the last observation directory.",
